  "id": "dill-pickles",
  "name": "Dill Pickles",
  "subtitle": "Crisp cucumber pickles with fresh dill and garlic",
  "description": "Prepare crunchy dill pickles in jars with a sweet-tart vinegar brine, fresh dill, and garlic. Refrigerate before serving and keep refrigerated.",
  "meal_type": "other",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "yield": {
